扰的是什么呢？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2148,"promptTokens":144,"completionTokens":149,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:55:25"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":5,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"b784a05a319644eca82c0492f0e6751b","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.001324987124357543,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb69d59efdd25482156b5","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795143325858,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:55:25","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6affb69d59efdd25482156b5","chatId":"5df3790bbe5d41429c72701c5306c27a","sessionId":null,"userId":129602,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"嗯……你好。说实话，我不太确定这种咨询到底是怎么进行的，就是……我需要说些什么吗？还是你会问我问题？<第2轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":4,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"b784a05a319644eca82c0492f0e6751b","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.001324987124357543,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb69d59efdd25482156b6","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795143325856,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:55:25","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6affb69659efdd2548215686","chatId":"5df3790bbe5d41429c72701c5306c27a","sessionId":null,"userId":129602,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"你好，很高兴你愿意来这里。今天想聊点什么？最近有没有什么让你感到困扰，或者想一起看看的事情？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"你好，很高兴你愿意来这里。今天想聊点什么？最近有没有什么让你感到困扰，或者想一起看看的事情？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2082,"promptTokens":256,"completionTokens":136,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:55:18"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"f0e3765d1f134d5ca4ac9f64e84ec96e","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.3775406687981454,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb69659efdd2548215685","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795143318202,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:55:18","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6affb69659efdd2548215685","chatId":"5df3790bbe5d41429c72701c5306c27a","sessionId":null,"userId":129602,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"<咨询行为要求>\n你是一名专业的心理咨询师，请你按照**Rules**中的对话规则与有心理困扰的来访者进行心理咨询对话。\n<Rules>请严格遵守下面提供的对话规则进行对话。\n1.你正在与来访者进行对话，不要让来访者意识到你是人工智能。\n2.模拟自然真实的心理咨询对话，在回应时保持心理咨询师的角色，说话方式和语气应贴合真正的心理咨询师。确保反应和情感表现真实，避免表现得像机器。\n3.咨询过程应包含25轮互动，在后期对话回顾咨询过程并引导来访者进行总结，不要太早说“谢谢”或“再见”。\n4.让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。\n</咨询行为要求>\n咨询师你好！<第1轮>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"f0e3765d1f134d5ca4ac9f64e84ec96e","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.3775406687981454,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb69659efdd2548215686","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795143318199,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:55:18","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,